  moveName: Whirlpool
  description: 'Create a 3s whirlpool at a location within 7m. Enemies inside are
    slowed by 25% and take six small damage pulses. After 0.9s, enemies still inside
    are pulled inward once (up to 1.25m). Overlapping slows do not stack; recently
    pulled enemies resist another Whirlpool pull for 1.5s. Does not displace objectives
    or hindrance-immune enemies. Upgrade: slow increases to 35%.'
